      55.15,
      478.79,
      549.69,
      532.13
    ],
    "text": "In terms of the regulations published in 308 numbered Gazette of Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka issued on 27th of June, 1984, under the Pilgrimages Ordinance (Chapter 175), it is hereby noti\ufb01ed that Annual Esala Festival 2025 of Ilangamgoda Ancient Raja Maha Viharaya (Sapugoda Pirivena) Sapugoda, Kamburupitiya in Matara District, Southern Province will be held from 10th of July to 17th of July 2025.",
